@*
    Archetype 13, numbered setup steps. Mirrors .steps in
    .design/handoff/PageMcpSetup.dc.html and PageConnectAgent.dc.html (rules in
    pages-content.css). Holds <SetupStep> children.

    This is the list, not a page: the two places that walk someone through a setup
    (connecting an assistant, registering the GitHub app) sit in different frames, one
    a page of its own and one a card inside a settings page, and share only the steps.
*@

<div class="steps">@ChildContent</div>

@code {
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
